<view class="portal-page"><view class="portal-title">我的消息</view><view class="portal-subtitle">每笔预约的沟通记录都在这里，已结束的预约也可以查看。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="portal-card portal-state portal-error">{{error}}<button class="portal-secondary" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="portal-state">正在加载消息…</view><view wx:elif="{{!items.length}}" class="portal-card portal-state">还没有沟通记录<button class="portal-secondary" bindtap="records">查看我的预约</button></view><view class="portal-card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="appointmentId" data-id="{{item.appointmentId}}" bindtap="open"><view class="portal-row"><view class="portal-icon">☏</view><view class="portal-row-main"><view class="portal-row-title">{{item.deviceType || '电脑维修'}} · 与社团沟通</view><view class="portal-row-desc">{{item.summary}}</view><view class="portal-meta">{{item.dateText}}</view></view><text wx:if="{{item.unread}}" class="portal-badge">{{item.unread > 99 ? '99+' : item.unread}}</text><text class="portal-arrow">›</text></view></view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="portal-secondary" bindtap="more" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">加载更多消息</button></view>
